      "value": "@{5a5e8041ab53aa544ac3c4c1|full_name}: It wasn't doing it in OpenBeta from what I remember. I have had Quest users in my world and nothing was happening. It was introduced on the release from OpenBeta to Release. Also Under Review means absolutely nothing.. Its close to 1 month and still no fix. I'd like my trees back.. Without doing workarounds.. :)",
